# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — dsdcc 1.9.6 测试套件硬编码 g++ + HMDFS jobserver fifo ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-25
# Software: dsdcc 1.9.6
# Gate: W3 / testfec 上游测试 12 用例
# Status: DRAFT — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv
#   4. Write knowledge/doc/E0XX.md

id:                     DRAFT-dsdcc-makefile-gxx-wrapper-hmdfs-fifo
trigger_tool:           make|g++|clang++|test
phase:                  testing
error_signature:        make: g\+\+: No such file or directory|
                         make: jobserver mkfifo: .*Operation not permitted|
                         g\+\+.*not found

severity:               2
category:               testing|makefile|toolchain|compiler|hmdfs|ohos
match_keywords:         make g++ not found, clang++ wrapper, PATH prepend,
                         HMDFS mkfifo jobserver, make -j1, independent test suite,
                         upstream test Makefile hardcode g++, OHOS no g++

title:                  OHOS 小型独立测试套件 (Makefile 硬编码 g++/cc) 运行: 用 PATH 前置 clang++ 符号链接包装 + make -j1 规避 HMDFS jobserver mkfifo 限制
error_excerpt:          make: g++: No such file or directory
                        make: jobserver mkfifo: /storage/Users/currentUser/tmp/GMfifo15508: Operation not permitted
root_cause:             HarmonyOS PC 工具链只有 clang/clang++(无 g++/cc/c++);上游独立测试 Makefile 常硬编码 g++;且 HMDFS 文件系统不支持 make jobserver 使用的 mkfifo, make -jN 并行会报 Operation not permitted
rec_approach:           创建 ~/tmp/bin/g++(及 cc/c++)指向 clang++/clang 的符号链接并 PATH 前置, 用 make -j1 编译(避免 jobserver fifo);不改动上游源码
verify_command:         PATH=~/tmp/bin:$PATH make -j1 && for t in ...; do ./$t; done
verify_exit_code:       0
vestigation_summary:    dsdcc 1.9.6 testfec 12 个自检用例全部编译并运行通过 (12/12)
similar_to:             E053
applies_to:             任何在 OHOS/HarmonyOS 上运行 Makefile 驱动的小型独立测试套件(非 CMake/ctest)
boundary:               不适用于 CMake/ctest/autotools configure 场景; CMake 项目用 CMakeToolchain 而非此包装